siness_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"c-Drp2IuAXSqjvyzvOPBzQ","review_id":"0m4rEY9L2cbFP8sj3gKJsg","date":"2018-09-16T23:33:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9380452036857605,"text_excerpt":"Delicious food. Great ambiance. Fantastic location. Great price point. Couldn't have been a better end to a FANTASTIC DAY!!! We happened upon this little find after another nearby restaurant was closed; it couldn't have been a better opportunity to try some place new if we had planned it. When I saw the name, I KNEW we were in for a treat. Crab cakes... Nachos... Bottomless margarita... Hello, Saints weren't the only winners today!!! Alex S our server was over the top, rendering great customer service. She made sure our glasses were always filled and that we had plenty to eat... She paid great attention to us, even though we weren't her only customers. The manager came over and chatted it..."},{"business_id":"c-Drp2IuAXSqjvyzvOPBzQ","review_id":"djYxD1026cwSmyzPVnCQEg","date":"2019-01-27T16:52:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9287574291229248,"text_excerpt":"I went here for my birthday; thanks to a special offer I received on Facebook. I could get any entree and one margarita for FREE! The ambiance is very mellow, intimate, and chill. I think it could be a great place for dates. My server was named Brad, and he was so sweet and courteous to me. I ordered the Butcher's Choice (beef steak and steak fries), Carla's Queso, and an Italian Margarita. I got my steak 'medium well', and it was exceptional. I was really into the Butcher fries, because they were like steak fries but really thin and crispy. If I recall, they were topped with pesto and parmesan cheese. The Italian Margarita is definitely a sweet drink for those that don't like the taste o..."},{"business_id":"c-Drp2IuAXSqjvyzvOPBzQ","review_id":"71uzLivWIYYeyTOFNa5EFg","date":"2019-01-27T23:10:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9286531209945679,"text_excerpt":"Really cool atmosphere .. we were greeted as soon as we walked in. There's a really nice tequila selection and the rosé sangria is really good. We had the crab cake as an appetizer - it was reasonably priced and very good! Our main dishes were simply amazing and you can tell they were prepared with quality fresh ingredients. Definitely will be back."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"c-Drp2IuAXSqjvyzvOPBzQ","photo_id":"gpwn3VMKYjANc1nsg6IrBQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/gpwn3VMKYjANc1nsg6IrBQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9173083901405334},{"business_id":"c-Drp2IuAXSqjvyzvOPBzQ","photo_id":"zWp4VqoA4lexD_uP-TNtoA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/zWp4VqoA4lexD_uP-TNtoA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9091250896453857},{"business_id":"c-Drp2IuAXSqjvyzvOPBzQ","photo_id":"hepq8YAIXsI0Inwqx6Dojw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hepq8YAIXsI0Inwqx6Dojw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7742578387260437},{"business_id":"c-Drp2IuAXSqjvyzvOPBzQ","photo_id":"Ov5qwBmvi6pZrOlE6ynP-A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Ov5qwBmvi6pZrOlE6ynP-A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7647988796234131},{"business_id":"c-Drp2IuAXSqjvyzvOPBzQ","photo_